@@ -30,6 +30,10 @@ These hold for every record, however it was made.

 ## Money

+- Schema 3 stores `costCents` per unit on each batch. Received batches use
+  the order line price; migration assigns existing batches their item price.
+  Stock value sums each batch value rounded to cents.
+
 - Money is an integer number of cents. A line (quantity × unit price) is
   rounded to the cent on its own (half up); totals are sums of rounded lines.
   Never sum unrounded amounts.
